00:00:36.885 --> 00:00:37.899
VIOLATING STATE LAWS.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.239
YOU’RE OPENLY DEFYING HIM ON

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:39.595
TELEVISION.

00:00:39.629 --> 00:00:42.194
WHAT DO YOU THINK IS GOING TO

00:00:42.195 --> 00:00:44.250
HAPPEN TO YOU WHEN YOU DO THIS?

00:00:44.251 --> 00:00:45.847
&gt;&gt; WE ARE PREPARED FOR ANY AND

00:00:45.881 --> 00:00:46.807
ALL CONSEQUENCES.

00:00:46.841 --> 00:00:49.141
OUR ACTIONS ON MONDAY ARE GOING

00:00:49.143 --> 00:00:53.557
TO BE GROUNDED IN THE IDEALS OF

00:00:53.558 --> 00:00:54.409
CIVIL DISOBEDIENCE.

00:00:54.411 --> 00:00:59.990
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HE SHOULD HAVE JUST

00:01:00.024 --> 00:01:02.328
