00:01:04.192 --> 00:01:04.545
HE DIDN’T.

00:01:04.546 --> 00:01:06.171
HE JOINS US TONIGHT.

00:01:06.205 --> 00:01:08.232
TELL US WHAT HAPPENED.

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:11.070
&gt;&gt; FROM THE LAST TIME THAT WE

00:01:11.072 --> 00:01:12.361
SPOKE, WE HAD LOST OUR NEWEST

00:01:12.362 --> 00:01:13.859
