00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:17.355
WAS ON FRIDAY OF LAST WEEK.

00:01:17.357 --> 00:01:19.183
THE GOVERNOR SAID AND REQUESTED

00:01:19.218 --> 00:01:20.827
IN COURT TO TAKE EXTRAORDINARY

00:01:20.861 --> 00:01:23.751
MEASURES TO STOP US FROM

00:01:23.752 --> 00:01:25.130
OPERATING IN BUSINESS.

00:01:25.131 --> 00:01:26.309
THE JUDGE AGREED.

00:01:26.343 --> 00:01:28.363
MY PARTNER AND I HAVE ADORES

00:01:28.397 --> 00:01:29.828
REMOVE SINCE THURSDAY AND WE HAD

00:01:29.829 --> 00:01:30.951
NOT LEFT THE BUILDING SINCE.

00:01:30.952 --> 00:01:32.802
WE HAD TWO WEEKS WORTH OF

00:01:32.803 --> 00:01:34.576
CLOTHING AND WE ARE PREPARED TO

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:36.224
STAY INSIDE AT ALL COST BUT WE

00:01:36.225 --> 00:01:37.605
